{
  "type": "record", "name": "BookOfRecord", "namespace": "demo.raw",
  "doc": "The book of record's own changes. change_type and changed_at are strings because that is what the normalizing statement reads: it compares change_type to 'DELETE' and parses changed_at with TO_TIMESTAMP.",
